<title>HONG KONG: Inter-Continental opens hotel in Uzbekistan.</title>
<headline>Inter-Continental opens hotel in Uzbekistan.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Inter-Continental Hotels and Resorts said on Thursday it had opened its first hotel in Tashkent, the capital of the central-Asian state of Uzbekistan.</p>
<p>The 245-room hotel is owned by InterService, a department of the Ministry of Foreign Economics Regulations of the Republic of Uzbekistan, and is managed by Inter-Continental Hotels and Resorts.</p>
<p>Inter-Continental Hotels is owned by the Saison Group of Japan.</p>
<p>- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
